  "body": "Clicking a soreness stripe on the Overview did nothing: the per-day hit targets only drove the hover panel. They now open that day's soreness record (which has Edit soreness), the same way strength and cardio nodes open theirs.\n\n- `buildTracks` records the entry per date on each track\n- `SorenessLanes` takes `onOpenSoreness` and wires it to the hit targets\n- `SorenessTab` passes it through\n\nVerified locally: clicking a stripe opened the Sep 16 soreness record. Lint, tests (7/7), and build pass.",
